He's obviously a criminal every which way
and you can't remove him and Republicans don't

00:00:27.619 --> 00:00:31.420
want to seriously what is wrong with your
country?

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.280
The world is laughing.

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:34.280
You know?

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:35.500
This is interesting for a few reasons.

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:42.300
It's interesting, number one, because there
are a lot of Trumpists who when they see that

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:48.399
attitude from someone in the UK about what
we're doing here about Trump being president,

00:00:48.399 --> 00:00:50.250
