00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:13.210
It's good for us and unfortunately those are
not people that can be reasoned with and I

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:14.400
shared this sympathy.

00:01:14.400 --> 00:01:15.710
I share these sentiments.

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:18.270
I sympathize with this perspective.

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:25.560
When I travel to Europe and talk to my friends
or family in the UK or in France, or when

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:32.590
I talk to my cousins in Israel, uh, who are
