example, in Canada, nobody really understands

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:40.820
what's going on there.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:46.650
Number one, feeling that they come to me with
his explain not just how this happened because

00:01:46.650 --> 00:01:52.080
okay, we can sort of understand there was
like a racist reaction to Obama.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:53.840
There was dislike of Hillary.

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:58.510
There was Trump bamboozling people into them
thinking that he is that the outsider guy

00:01:58.510 --> 00:02:04.430
who's gonna, you know, economic anxiety, preying
