00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:05.430
status.

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:06.460
They get all that.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:07.670
But it's been two and a half years now.

00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:09.460
It's been two and a half years.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:11.580
How is everybody not against the sky?

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:16.280
And what you need to understand is that everybody
