00:02:44.919 --> 00:02:49.709
and that doesn't include any kind of culpability
in it.

00:02:49.709 --> 00:02:50.709
Okay?

00:02:50.709 --> 00:02:51.870
It's hyper partisanship.

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.160
It's cognitive dissonance.

00:02:53.160 --> 00:02:59.820
It is also to use your term, it is stupidity
